# DESK13 run B -- Options -> Set preferences..., all six ADSETPRE groups.
# Options title x 160..232; SetPrefs is entry 6 (five items + one separator),
# y = 19 + 6*16 = 115..131, centre 123.
# The box is 408x308, so `form_center` puts it at ((640-408)/2, 19+(480-19-308)/2)
# = (116,95); Cancel sits at (259,270) inside it -> (375,365) on screen.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 196 8
1800 move 200 123
2000 down
2003 up
2300 parkbr
3000 mark B_PREFS
3300 move 375 365
3500 down
3503 up
3800 parkbr
4400 mark C_CLOSED
